    "Condition : 1 - This development must be completed and use of the premises failing within use class C3 commence before 15 APRIL 2018.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2.\tPrior to the occupation, in accordance with approved drawings, the car parking space for residential use shall be market out for residents use only. This area shall be permanently retained thereafter and not be used for any other purpose at any time.",
